# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every
# platform. Prettier is configured with endOfLine: "lf" (.prettierrc.mjs), so
# without this a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) produces CRLF files that
# `pnpm run format:check` rejects locally while CI, running on Linux, passes.
* text=auto eol=lf
